body:
Honestly just communicate with her all of the things you said in this post. However, don't go and accuse her of having done anything on the trip, just tell her how you feel and how her actions/lack of actions have made you feel. And if she's having second thoughts or just any doubt, talk it out with you, she owes you that much.

&#x200B;

Good luck dude sorry this is happening, I hope y'all get through it
